WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.039 --> 00:00:09.874
&gt;&gt; Sean: IN TIME FOR MORE ON

00:00:08.973 --> 00:00:11.108
WHAT WE CALLED SELECTIVE MORAL

00:00:10.007 --> 00:00:13.044
OUTRAGE ON THIS PROGRAM.

00:00:11.242 --> 00:00:14.879
WE BRING IN JUANITA BRODERICK

00:00:13.177 --> 00:00:16.080
TOLD THE STORY ABOUT

00:00:15.012 --> 00:00:16.881
BILL CLINTON AND RATE BACK IN

00:00:16.214 --> 00:00:18.449
THE 70s.

00:00:17.014 --> 00:00:21.686
ALSO WITH US, THE AUTHOR OF THE

00:00:18.583 --> 00:00:22.120
NUMBER ONE BEST SELLER,

00:00:21.819 --> 00:00:24.455
GREGG JARRETT.

00:00:22.253 --> 00:00:26.591
I DID THE SECOND INTERVIEW WITH

00:00:24.589 --> 00:00:28.459
YOU, AND EVEN THROUGH THIS LAST

00:00:26.724 --> 00:00:31.095
ELECTION, A LOT OF THE PEOPLE WE

00:00:28.593 --> 00:00:32.497
ARE HEARING FROM NOW, THEY WERE

00:00:31.329 --> 00:00:34.465
SILENT.

00:00:32.630 --> 00:00:36.400
THEY NEVER WANTED -- THEY DIDN'T

00:00:34.599 --> 00:00:37.635
WANT AN FBI INVESTIGATION FOR

00:00:36.534 --> 00:00:41.372
YOU THAT I REMEMBER.

00:00:37.769 --> 00:00:41.873
&gt;&gt; OH, NO, SENATOR FEINSTEIN,

00:00:41.506 --> 00:00:42.774
SENATOR DURBIN AND

00:00:42.006 --> 00:00:45.076
SENATOR SCHUMER WANTED NOTHING

00:00:42.907 --> 00:00:47.679
TO DO WITH MY CASE.

00:00:45.209 --> 00:00:50.381
ALL DEMOCRATS REFUSED TO READ MY

00:00:47.812 --> 00:00:50.715
DEPOSITION WITH THE INDEPENDENT

00:00:50.515 --> 00:00:51.549
COUNSEL.

00:00:50.848 --> 00:00:53.084
&gt;&gt; Sean: THEY NEVER ONCE

00:00:51.683 --> 00:00:54.018
REACHED OUT TO YOU?

00:00:53.217 --> 00:00:57.655
THE PEOPLE THAT ARE STILL THERE,

00:00:54.152 --> 00:00:59.123
THE ONES ACTING, YOU KNOW, THE

00:00:57.789 --> 00:01:00.425
ONES THAT ARE SO SUPPORTIVE OF

00:00:59.257 --> 00:01:04.662
THE ALLEGATIONS?

00:01:00.558 --> 00:01:04.929
&gt;&gt; NO THEY NEVER REACHED OUT TO

00:01:04.796 --> 00:01:05.863
ME.

00:01:05.063 --> 00:01:09.467
&gt;&gt; Sean: WHEN THIS HAPPENED TO

00:01:05.997 --> 00:01:10.568
YOU, BECAUSE I KNOW BECAUSE I'VE

00:01:09.601 --> 00:01:11.402
INTERVIEWED IT, IT WAS

00:01:10.702 --> 00:01:15.139
30 MINUTES LATER YOU TOLD THE

00:01:11.536 --> 00:01:16.274
WOMAN YOU ARE WITH AND YOUR LIP

00:01:15.273 --> 00:01:18.009
WAS THREE TIMES ITS NORMAL SIZE?

00:01:16.407 --> 00:01:18.943
&gt;&gt; RIGHT, AND BLEEDING.

00:01:18.142 --> 00:01:20.912
THE WOMAN CAME BACK TO THE ROOM

00:01:19.077 --> 00:01:22.313
AND FOUND ME WHEN I DIDN'T SHOW

00:01:21.045 --> 00:01:23.915
UP FOR THE SEMINAR AND OF

00:01:22.447 --> 00:01:25.750
COURSE, I TOLD HER IMMEDIATELY,

00:01:24.048 --> 00:01:28.119
LOOK AT THE CONDITION I WAS IN.

00:01:25.884 --> 00:01:31.389
MY CLOTHES WERE TORN, MY LIP WAS

00:01:28.253 --> 00:01:34.125
HUGE, AND I WAS DEVASTATED.

00:01:31.523 --> 00:01:36.094
&gt;&gt; Sean: AND AFRAID OF.

00:01:34.259 --> 00:01:37.495
&gt;&gt; OH GOODNESS, YES.

00:01:36.227 --> 00:01:39.497
&gt;&gt; Sean: AND NOBODY -- THE

00:01:37.629 --> 00:01:42.100
DEMOCRATS, THE SAME PEOPLE THAT

00:01:39.631 --> 00:01:42.434
WERE ACTING SO INDIGNANT,

00:01:42.233 --> 00:01:43.702
NOTHING?

00:01:42.567 --> 00:01:45.003
&gt;&gt; ABSOLUTELY NOTHING.

00:01:43.835 --> 00:01:46.871
&gt;&gt; Sean: GREGG JARRETT, FROM A

00:01:45.136 --> 00:01:48.006
LEGAL STANDPOINT, THE FBI HAS

00:01:47.005 --> 00:01:50.875
ALSO SAID THAT THIS IS NOT

00:01:48.139 --> 00:01:51.876
WITHIN THEIR JURISDICTION.

00:01:51.009 --> 00:01:54.079
WE PLAYED JOE BIDEN.

00:01:52.010 --> 00:01:55.647
THIS WAS A TALKING POINT FOR

00:01:54.212 --> 00:01:56.881
DELAY TODAY, WASN'T IT?

00:01:55.780 --> 00:01:59.651
&gt;&gt; THAT'S RIGHT.

00:01:57.015 --> 00:02:00.685
BY LAW THE FBI IS NOT ALLOWED TO

00:01:59.784 --> 00:02:03.088
INVESTIGATE A NONFEDERAL CRIME.

00:02:00.819 --> 00:02:04.890
THEY CAN ONLY DO BACKGROUND

00:02:03.221 --> 00:02:05.724
CHECKS, AND AS BIDEN POINTED

00:02:05.023 --> 00:02:08.727
OUT, THEY SIMPLY TAKE WITNESS

00:02:05.857 --> 00:02:10.896
STATEMENTS, THEY DON'T JUDGE

00:02:08.860 --> 00:02:12.064
GUILT OR INNOCENCE OR THE

00:02:11.029 --> 00:02:12.664
CREDIBILITY OF PARTICULAR

00:02:12.197 --> 00:02:13.932
WITNESSES.

00:02:12.798 --> 00:02:17.603
SO IT WAS AN UTTER CANARD OVER

00:02:14.066 --> 00:02:20.272
AND OVER AGAIN CALL FOR

00:02:17.736 --> 00:02:21.440
CAVANAUGH TO ASK FOR AN FBI

00:02:20.405 --> 00:02:22.875
INVESTIGATION.

00:02:21.573 --> 00:02:24.743
&gt;&gt; Sean: JUANITA, YOU WERE

00:02:23.008 --> 00:02:27.679
HERE TODAY AND EVEN DURING 2016,

00:02:24.877 --> 00:02:28.480
YOU FELT COMPELLED TO SPEAK UP

00:02:27.813 --> 00:02:30.282
ABOUT THE DOUBLE STANDARD.

00:02:28.614 --> 00:02:34.019
WHAT DO YOU SAY TO THOSE

00:02:30.415 --> 00:02:35.187
DEMOCRATS THAT, CLEARLY, THIS IS

00:02:34.153 --> 00:02:35.888
ABOUT POLITICS AND NOT ABOUT

00:02:35.320 --> 00:02:42.060
WHAT'S RIGHT?

00:02:36.021 --> 00:02:42.661
&gt;&gt; WELL, I CLEARLY THINK IF

00:02:42.194 --> 00:02:43.462
SENATOR FEINSTEIN AND

00:02:42.794 --> 00:02:46.698
SENATOR DURBIN HAD KNOWN THAT I

00:02:43.595 --> 00:02:47.699
WAS OUTSIDE, I THINK THEY SHOULD

00:02:46.832 --> 00:02:50.669
HAVE WALKED OUT AND APOLOGIZE TO

00:02:47.833 --> 00:02:51.370
ME FOR WHAT THEY DID TO ME IN

00:02:50.802 --> 00:02:53.705
1999, COMPLETELY TURNING THEIR

00:02:51.503 --> 00:02:55.374
BACKS ON ME.

00:02:53.839 --> 00:02:56.909
&gt;&gt; Sean: AND KATHLEEN AND

00:02:55.507 --> 00:02:58.477
PAULA AND JENNIFER, WHO WAS

00:02:57.042 --> 00:02:59.511
CALLED A LIAR.

00:02:58.610 --> 00:03:01.280
&gt;&gt; EXACTLY, YES.

